# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A fireworks show with the time to the second on a scrim BAND rather than a
# full scrim, so the show stays bright around it. HH:MM:SS fits 32 px only in
# the `tiny` face. The burst sprites are ADDED and run at different `A` rates
# so they never pop together; all three sit in the sky above and under the
# band. Designed at 32x32 (`U`): a bigger panel zooms the whole show.
S - New Year's Eve
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Fireworks
I @pat/fireworks
C sliderLaunchRate 3932160
L sprite 1 0 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Burst
I @spr/firework-burst
A 9
L sprite 17 0 0 0 add 100 none fill 3
N Burst 2
I @spr/firework-burst
A 7
L sprite 9 0 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Burst 3
I @spr/firework-burst
A 11
L color 0 11 0 9 normal 60 none fill 1
N Band
L text 0 13 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Time
T clock HH:MM:SS
F tiny ffffff c none 0
L text 0 24 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Greeting
T lit HAPPY NEW YEAR
F tiny ffd166 l left 14
